<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
  <div class="accent-bar"></div>
  <h2>A Hobby That<br />Got Out of Hand</h2>

  <p>
    I work in enterprise technology for a living — the kind of work that pays well and
    rarely comes up in conversation. This site isn't that. It's the stuff I build because
    I want to, on my own time, usually because I got curious about how something works
    and couldn't let it go until I'd built it myself.
  </p>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <p>
      I came to technology through an unusual door — <strong>English</strong> and
      <strong>Computer Science</strong>, for reasons that made sense at the time. That
      combination still shows up in how I write about these projects: I'd rather explain
      why something works than just show that it does.
    </p>
    <p>
      The projects here span <strong>home-lab infrastructure</strong>, <strong>edge AI</strong>,
      and <strong>cloud architecture</strong>, with the occasional detour into whatever new
      tool just came out. I don't optimize for polish. I optimize for learning something
      I didn't know before I started.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p class="closing-line">
    If you want to see how any of it actually works, the write-ups below go
    deeper than they probably need to.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 6rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .accent-bar {
    width: 48px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--accent-dark);
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  p strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

  .bridge-block {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-dark);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.06);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .bridge-block p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .about-grid p { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .credentials {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .credentials h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .cert-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cert-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .closing-line {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .closing-line strong { color: var(--text); font-style: normal; }
</style>
